These sounds are the "zen" pack from uisfx by Romain Simon:
https://github.com/romainsimon/uisfx, commit 9950fe6
(packages/uisfx/sounds/zen/*.ogg).

They are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (see LICENSE-AUDIO,
copied unchanged from packages/uisfx/LICENSE-AUDIO).

Changes made for Xidou Shell:
- Only the 59 cues mapped in docs/ROADMAP.md section 7 are kept. The other
  19 are left out.
- Each .ogg was converted once to 16-bit PCM WAV with the same sample rate
  and channels (`ffmpeg -i <cue>.ogg -map_metadata -1 -fflags +bitexact
  -c:a pcm_s16le <cue>.wav`), because Qt's SoundEffect plays WAV only.
- cues.json holds each cue's default volume and loop flag, copied from the
  pack's manifest.json (the same values as src/catalog.ts's CUES table).
